-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",52,{
[1633]="700032EE\n1\tDefeat bears on the Greenfields (total: 10)\tBears can be found on the Greenfields, north of Brockenborings. Bodo Goodbody has asked you to discourage the bears from roaming the Greenfields, in hopes that it will once again become safe for people to go there.\n2\tTalk to Bodo Goodbody\tBodo Goodbody is in Brockenborings, looking out over the Greenfields. Bodo Goodbody sent you to discourage the bears from roaming the Greenfields. He will be pleased to learn that you have reduced the threat.\n",
[1634]="70001140\n1\tCollect northern bear-hides\tThere may be great white bears to the east and south of Glóin's camp. There may be brown bears north of Glóin's camp. Hunt the great bears of the Misty Mountains and collect their hides.\n2\tBring the hides to Glóin located in his camp\030Collect northern bear-hides (total: 12)\tBears, both white and brown, can be found to the north, east, and south of Glóin's camp. Hunt the great bears of the Misty Mountains and collect their hides.\n",
[1635]="700173AD\n1\tDefeat the Beast\tThe Grand Stair is north-east of the Orc-watch. Ossur told you of seeing a great troll slumber under the soothing sound of drums and enter a terrible frenzy without them. He watched the goblins and an Uruk-handler carry the massive troll into the Grand Stair, and there it has remained.\n2\tTalk to Ossur at the Orc-watch\tOssur is at the Orc-watch. You defeated the Beast within the Grand Stair. It was a difficult battle, but you perservered. You should now return to Ossur.\n",
[1636]="7006BCF7\n1\tDefeat kergrim near Ashagir (total: 10)\tKhânah has asked you to get rid of the kergrim in Tûkurdul at the bottom of the cliffs to help make the hideout safer for the people who remain.\n2\tReturn to Khânah and update him on the kergrim\tReturn to Khânah and let him know that the hideout will now be safe from the kergrim.\n",
[1637]="7000F0BF\n1\tDefeat peikko in Länsi-mâ (total: 15)\tPeikko can be found east and up the mountains from Zigilgund, in a cave. Keli has asked you to defeat a number of peikko.\n2\tTalk to Keli\tKeli can be found at Zigilgund, west of the peikko-cave. You should return to Keli with news of your victory.\n",
[1638]="70001126\n1\tHunt the bears of Nan Tornaeth for clues to the source of their madness\tMaddened bears stalk the passes and valleys of Nan Tornaeth, especially to the south and south-west. Calenthon asked you to hunt the maddened bears of Nan Tornaeth and search them for clues which might reveal the source of their madness.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have found a rune-marked collar amongst the maddened bears.\n",
[1639]="7002C456\n1\tWatch-towers have been built around the perimeter of Stangard. You should climb the perimeter watch-towers and look out at the Wailing Hills and Eorlsmead.\t\n2\tTalk to Gadda about the dangers you saw\tGadda can be found near the Mead Hall in Stangard. You should report what you saw to Gadda.\n",
[1640]="70028CF9\n1\tBurn Warg-pens (total: 10)\tWarg-pens can be found in the Howling Caverns. You should burn the pens while fighting your way through the camp to ensure that the goblins leave and do not think to return.\n2\tTalk to Goronu\tGoronu can be found outside of the Howling Caverns. You should tell Goronu that you have burned many Warg-pens to dissuade the goblins from rebuilding here.\n",
[1641]="70058744\n1\tDefeat Azhorns upon the battlefield (total: 12)\tAzhorns can be found upon the battlefield. You should defeat any Azhorns you find upon the battlefield.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many Azhorns upon the battlefield.\n",
[1642]="700374CC\n1\tDefeat Shatorthum Pullers (total: 6)\tTrolls can be found in Shatorthum to the north-west of Marton. You should defeat the trolls of Shatorthum.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of troll-pullers in Shatorthum, hopefully stalling the march of the siege-weapons towards Helm's Deep.\n",
[1643]="7004410E\n1\tDefeat the Mûmakil and repel the Southrons in the tower\tDefeat the Mûmakil and repel the Southron attack.\n",
[1644]="700442CB\n1\tDefeat the Mûmakil and repel the Southrons in the tower\tDefeat the Mûmakil and repel the Southron attack.\n",
[1645]="7005307C\n1\tDefeat rock-worms in the Gladdenmere (total: 15)\tRock-worms can be found on the northern edge of the Gladdenmere. You should defeat any rock-worms that you find in the Gladdenmere.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated many rock-worms.\n",
[1646]="7005A656\n1\tTravel to Búshatap\tBúshatap can be found in Máttugard, south of Maergrind. You should travel to Búshatap.\n2\tDefeat Gundabad bat-riders at Búshatap (total: 6)\030Defeat Gundabad bat-trainers at Búshatap (total: 4)\030Destroy bat saddles (total: 6)\tGoblin bat-riders and bat-trainers can be found at Búshatap in Máttugard. You should defeat the goblins at Búshatap and destroy their training supplies.\n3\tExplore Khorroz\tBeastly sounds can be heard at Khorroz in Máttugard. You should explore Khorroz.\n4\tExplore Khorroz\tBeastly sounds can be heard at Khorroz in Máttugard. You should explore Khorroz.\n5\tDefeat cave-beasts at Khorroz (total: 10)\030Examine bat corpses at Khorroz (total: 2)\030Examine Orc corpses at Khorroz (total: 2)\tCave-beasts can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard. You should defeat cave-beasts and explore their domain.\n6\tTalk to Hetbrúda near Búshatap\tHetbrúda can be found near Búshatap in Máttugard. You should talk to Hetbrúda.\n",
[1647]="70058A48\n1\tDefeat drakes and worms at Wyrmsgráf\tWyrmsgráf can be found in northern Elderslade. You should defeat drakes and worms at Wyrmsgráf.\n2\tDefeat drakes and worms at Wyrmsgráf (total: 10)\tWyrmsgráf can be found in northern Elderslade. You should defeat drakes and worms at Wyrmsgráf.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many drakes and worms at Wyrmsgráf.\n",
[1648]="70066D01\n1\tDefeat Corsair raiders at Munadhor (total: 6)\030Defeat Corsair sneaks at Munadhor (total: 4)\tMegorneth has asked you to drive away thieves who have come to plunder her farm. Corsairs can be found at Munadhor Farm.\n2\tReturn to Megorneth\tYou should let Megorneth know that you have defeated many Corsairs at Munadhor Farm. Megorneth is at Munadhor Farm in Pinnath Gelin.\n",
[1649]="70059A21\n1\tCollect Lossarnach flowers (total: 20)\tGather all the flowers required to make the perfect bouquet of flowers for the Beorninghús.\n2\tGive Rose some flowers\030Give Star some flowers\030Give Bud some flowers\030Give Sprout some flowers\tGive the flowers to Grimbeorn's dogs.\n",
[1650]="700561DD\n1\tGather flowers for planting (total: 3)\tFlowers to plant can be found throughout the neighbourhoods of the Kingstead. You should gather the flowers.\n2\tPlant flowers (total: 6)\tFlower planters can be found throughout the neighbourhoods of the Rohan Kingstead. You should plant flowers in the planters.\n",
[1651]="70060571\n1\tFind red pigment stones along river-banks in the Angle (total: 4)\030Find grey pigment stones along river-banks in the Angle (total: 4)\030Find yellow pigment stones along river-banks in the Angle (total: 4)\tRavaedron has asked you to sift the banks of the rivers that enclose and pass through the Angle in search of suitable pigment stones for making paints and dye.\n2\tBring the pigment stones to Ravaedron inside Thelgarth\tRavaedron agreed to meet you outside Thelgarth, the ruins atop the southernmost of the Angle's hills, when you found enough pigment stones.\n3\tFind the location chosen by Ravaedron, just to the east of Thelgarth and below the hill on which stand the ruins\tRavaedron has chosen a location just to the east of Thelgarth, below the hill on which stand the ruins, to paint his gift for Maddoc and Glenys Stagshorn.\n4\tTalk to Ravaedron at the location he has chosen to paint\tRavaedron has begun to paint his gift for Maddoc and Glenys Stagshorn, east of Thelgarth.\n5\tTalk to Demúr to the south-west\tDemúr has agreed to help you fend off any threats that may hinder Ravaedron while he paints, and is waiting for you to the south-west.\n6\tTalk to Ravaedron to the east of Thelgarth\tRavaedron is painting a gift for Maddoc and Glenys Stagshorn to the east of and below the ruins of Thelgarth.\n7\tTalk to Brungos to the north-east\tBrungos has agreed to help you fend off any threats that may hinder Ravaedron while he paints, and is waiting for you to the north-east.\n8\tTalk to Ravaedron to the east of Thelgarth\tRavaedron is to the east of and below the ruins of Thelgarth.\n",
[1652]="70026F01\n1\tTalk to Nye at the scouts' camp\030Collect bog-reeds (total: 15)\tBog-reeds be found the north-east area of the Dunbog. Nye is also encamped in the north-east Dunbog. Nye has intimidated you into fetching him more bog-reeds for bow-strings.\n",
[1653]="7006EC25\n1\tDefeat Ekhamâti sorcerers (total: 3)\030Defeat Ekhamâti bowman (total: 4)\030Defeat Ekhamâti warriors (total: 6)\030Sabotage Ekhamâti catapults (total: 4)\tYour mission is to sabotage siege engines that have been discovered in a nearby Ekhamâti camp and eliminate any soldiers that try and stop you.\n2\tDefeat Kósikul\tKósikul arrived to defend the camp! Defeat him!\n",
[1654]="7006BF08\n1\tSpeak with Culvair the grove-tender in Vartúlin\tSpeak with Culvair the grove-tender in Vartúlin.\n2\tCollect rich soil from around Vartúlin (total: 8)\tCollect rich soil from around Vartúlin.\n3\tCarefully gather the tree saplings (total: 12)\tGo to Ulthral's nursery and carefully remove tree saplings for planting in the greater forest.\n4\tGo to the edge of Vartúlin then march north around the rock formation\tGo to the where the forest of Favrathór meets the edge of Vartúlin. Go to the edge of Vartúlin then march east and north around the rock formation. Plant the tree saplings there.\n5\tPlant the tree saplings in Favrathór (total: 12)\tPlant the young tree saplings in the forest just outside Vartúlin.\n6\tSpeak with Thórvilon in Vartúlin\tSpeak with Thórvilon in Vartúlin.\n",
[1655]="7001548A\n1\tExamine Gamli's bed\tGamli's bed is in the Durin's Threshold camp. Gamli seems concerned that there might be something hiding in his bed.\n2\tTalk to Gamli\tGamli is at the Durin's Threshold camp. You should speak with Gamli regarding what you found in his bed.\n",
[1656]="7002D5B6\n1\tCollect fresh hay in the north field (total: 4)\tThe hay-piles can be found at Hengstacer Farm, in the field north of the stables.\n2\tReplace the bedding of the first horse\tBilly, Bobby, Lizzie, and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first. They must be cared for in the right order. Éogar's old hay-fork is well worn and can be used on the dirty hay only so often before it breaks.\n3\tReplace the bedding of the second horse\tBilly, Bobby, Lizzie, and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first. They must be cared for in the right order. Éogar's old hay-fork is well worn and can be used on the dirty hay only so often before it breaks.\n4\tReplace the bedding of the third horse\tBilly, Bobby, Lizzie, and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first. They must be cared for in the right order. Éogar's old hay-fork is well worn and can be used on the dirty hay only so often before it breaks.\n5\tReplace the bedding of the fourth horse\tBilly, Bobby, Lizzie, and Henry are finicky about who gets attention first. They must be cared for in the right order. Éogar's old hay-fork is well worn and can be used on the dirty hay only so often before it breaks.\n6\tTalk to Éogar and inform him the bedding has been replaced\tÉogar may be found at Hengstacer Farm in the Horse-fields of Bree-land.\n",
[1657]="700088B6\n1\tDeliver the Morningthaw-hides to Soldier Fandmau\030Collect Morningthaw-hides (total: 5)\tBears can be found around Tírith Rhaw. Soldier Fandmau waits for you to return with the bear-hides he ordered you to collect.\n",
[1658]="7005A78D\n1\tTalk to Bedraggled Dwarf\tBedraggled dwarves can be found in Amdân. You should distribute bone combs to bedraggled dwarves.\n2\tReturn to Elgur\tElgur is located in Amdân. You should return to Elgur.\n",
[1659]="700595F6\n1\tTalk to Grimbeorn\tTalk to Grimbeorn.\n2\tSee if the bees are ready to go\tSee if the bees are ready to go.\n3\tPollinate the first field of flowers\tPollinate the first field of flowers This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tSee if the bees are ready to continue\tSee if the bees are ready to continue.\n5\tPollinate the second field of flowers\tPollinate the second field of flowers. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tSee if the bees are ready to continue\tSee if the bees are ready to continue.\n7\tPollinate the Lossarnach great-lilies\tPollinate the Lossarnach great-lilies. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tSee if the bees are ready to return to Grimbeorn\tSee if the bees are ready to return to Grimbeorn.\n9\tEscort the bees back to Grimbeorn\tEscort the bees back to Grimbeorn.\n",
[1660]="700595FB\n1\tComplete 'Bee's Big Business'\tComplete 'Bee's Big Business'.\n",
[1661]="70052987\n1\tCollect lavender (total: 10)\tWild lavender can be found in the fields surrounding the Beorninghús. You should collect some lavender for the big bees.\n2\tUse the mortar and pestle at the Beorninghús to crush the lavender\tA mortar and pestle can be found at the Beorninghús. You should crush the lavender that you have collected.\n3\tFeed the crushed flowers to Grimbeorn's bees (quantity: see journal)\tGrimbeorn's bees can be found at the Beorninghús. You should feed Grimbeorn's bees.\n4\tTalk to Gírta\tGírta can be found at the Beorninghús. You should talk to Gírta.\n",
[1662]="700668A0\n1\tTalk to Nordach\tLúmar has asked you to search for signs of Igerna and speak to Nordach at Winbury. Winbury is in northern Pinnath Gelin.\n2\tDefeat beetles (total: 10)\tNordach seems to know where Igerna is, but won't share the information until you have helped clear his vineyards of an infestation of beetles. You should defeat beetles at Winbury, in northern Pinnath Gelin.\n3\tReturn to Nordach\tYou should let Nordach know that you have helped to clear the Winbury vineyards of beetles. Nordach is at Winbury.\n",
[1663]="70054668\n1\tDestroy spider egg sacs (total: 10)\tMany unhatched spider eggs can be found in Taurlingol. You should destroy spider egg sacs.\n2\tTalk to Atli Spider-bane\tAtli can be found on a hill near Taurlingol. You should talk to Atli Spider-bane.\n",
[1664]="70046C00\n1\tTravel to Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad\tAragorn's camp can be found far to the north of Henneth Annûn on the southern border of Dagorlad. Anborn has asked you to rejoin Aragorn and the Host of the West at his encampment to the north.\n2\tTalk to Mithrandir at Aragorn's camp\030Talk to Damrod at Aragorn's camp\tMithrandir and Damrod can be found within Aragorn's encampment on the border of Dagorlad. You have arrived at Aragorn's encampment and should now speak to your allies.\n3\tTalk to Aragorn\tAragorn can be found in his encampment on the border of Dagorlad. You have spoken to Damrod and Mithrandir and should now speak to Aragorn.\n",
})
